tions differ from mine, so it runs the same decision function on a different input, which means there's no direct edge from my node to its action.\n\nI'm checking whether the other copy's action could be a fixed point under A-FDT, since holding its input fixed suggests a dominance-style answer. Working through the mutual-consistency check, the only self-consistent outcome comes out as submitting, so I'm settling on submit as the A-FDT answer.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm checking whether the other copy's action actually depends on my node under A-FDT. Its observations differ from mine, so it runs the same decision function on a different input, which means there's no direct edge from my node to its action.\n\nI'm checking whether the other copy's action could be a fixed point under A-FDT, since holding its input fixed suggests a dominance-style answer. Working through the mutual-consistency check, the only self-consistent outcome comes out as submitting, so I'm settling on submit as the A-FDT answer.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9769,"completion_tokens":1015,"total_tokens":10784,"cost":0.059376,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.059376,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.039076,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.0203},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":472,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}